          <p class="text-sm text-slate-400 mt-1">Compare <strong class="text-slate-100">low, middle, high cloud cover and relative humidity</strong> at multiple forecast grid locations for the same hour. This is a coordinate map, not a satellite image or a measured cloud-top map.</p>
        </div>
